{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"act38side_level_act38side_08_end","storyGroup":"act38side","storySort":18,"storyDependence":"act38side_level_act38side_08_beg","storyCanShow":1,"storyCode":"PV-8","storyName":"无私铁棘","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"知晓市政厅和法院动作的小威尼斯逼迫老威尼斯“退休”，决定趁狂欢节控制整座城市。明白了卡车互助会从未从家族阴影中脱身，伊雷妮决定组织司机们与家族做个了断。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"activities/act38side/level_act38side_08_end","avgTag":"行动后","unLockType":"BY_START_TIME","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"act38side_08","minState":"PASS","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":16,"next":18,"characters":["惶恐的家族成员","老威尼斯","安东尼奥","拉维妮娅","卡车司机","伊雷妮","柳德米拉"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":1},{"type":"stopmusic","id":2},{"type":"dialog","id":3},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/31/Avg_bg_33_g7_reception.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":4},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":5},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":6},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$nervous_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act9d0d0/m_avg_nervous_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":7,"musicid":0},{"type":"animtext","id":8,"name":"group_location_stamp","style":"avg_only_medium","pos":"-400,-200","block":"false","text":"<p=2>1100年11月8日    6:15 P.M.</>"},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":9},{"type":"animtextclean","id":10},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":11},{"type":"playsound","key":"$doorknockquite","id":12},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":13},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1555_1#1$1","duration":"0.5","id":14},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":15},{"type":"dialogue","name":"惶恐的家族成员","text":"老爷，您找我？","id":16,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f8/Avg_avg_npc_1555_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1545_1#1$1","id":17},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老威尼斯","text":"安东有话问你。","id":18,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_npc_1545_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1544_1#1$1","id":19},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安东尼奥","text":"卡尔，这边。","id":20,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/89/Avg_avg_npc_1544_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1555_1#1$1","id":21},{"type":"dialogue","name":"惶恐的家族成员","text":"安东尼奥......","id":22,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f8/Avg_avg_npc_1555_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1544_1#1$1","id":23},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安东尼奥","text":"最近新沃尔西尼还有车队发往西西里城吗？","id":24,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/89/Avg_avg_npc_1544_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1555_1#1$1","id":25},{"type":"dialogue","name":"惶恐的家族成员","text":"客运航线都在正常运转。不过这段时间都是赶来新沃尔西尼参加狂欢节的，倒没什么人往外面跑。","id":26,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f8/Avg_avg_npc_1555_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1544_1#1$1","id":27},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安东尼奥","text":"那就好。","id":28,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/89/Avg_avg_npc_1544_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安东尼奥","text":"你现在去收拾行李，应该还来得及赶上末班车。","id":29,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/89/Avg_avg_npc_1544_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1555_1#1$1","id":30},{"type":"multiline","name":"惶恐的家族成员","text":"好的——","id":31},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.2","xstrength":"15","ystrength":"15","vibrato":"20","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":32},{"type":"multiline","name":"惶恐的家族成员","text":"啊、啊？安东尼奥，这是什么意思？","id":33},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1544_1#1$1","id":34},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安东尼奥","text":"你不是还有个兄弟在西西里城吗？如果不能继续留在新沃尔西尼，也不能返回蒙特卢佩，你应该只能去投奔他吧。","id":35,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/89/Avg_avg_npc_1544_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1544_1#4$1","id":36},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安东尼奥","text":"因为你的疏忽，我们丢了整整一车“轮胎”。","id":37,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7b/Avg_avg_npc_1544_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1544_1#8$1","id":38},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安东尼奥","text":"我给过你机会，但哪怕只是去港口迎接家主，你竟然也没能办好。萨卢佐家的老混蛋甚至在你之前找到了家主。","id":39,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/70/Avg_avg_npc_1544_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安东尼奥","text":"卡尔，你还能活着离开，已经是我能给你的最体面的结局。拿着这个——","id":40,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/70/Avg_avg_npc_1544_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":41},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_paper2","id":42},{"type":"text","text":"那是一张银行的本票，数目不小。","id":43},{"type":"text","text":"家族成员愣愣地接过来，他看见左上角写着自己的名字，安东尼奥已经在上面画了一个叉。","id":44},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1544_1#4$1","id":45},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安东尼奥","text":"安置费。没了家族的庇佑，你要用钱的地方多得很。","id":46,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7b/Avg_avg_npc_1544_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1555_1#1$1","id":47},{"type":"dialogue","name":"惶恐的家族成员","text":"我在家族待了十几年，在你来之前，我就一直跟着老爷，你不能当着老爷的面，对我——","id":48,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f8/Avg_avg_npc_1555_1$1.png"},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"15","ystrength":"15","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":49},{"type":"dialogue","name":"惶恐的家族成员","text":"老爷，老爷——","id":50,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f8/Avg_avg_npc_1555_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1544_1#1$1","id":51},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安东尼奥","text":"员工犯了错，自然要受到惩罚，您觉得呢？","id":52,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/89/Avg_avg_npc_1544_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1545_1#1$1","id":53},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老威尼斯","text":"当然，你是威尼斯载具公司的负责人。","id":54,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_npc_1545_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":55},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1555_1#1$1","id":56},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":57},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1555_1#1$1","posfrom":"-200,0","posto":"-200,0","duration":"0.5","id":58},{"type":"delay","time":"0.7","id":59},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","posfrom":"-200,0","posto":"-80,0","duration":"0.5","id":60},{"type":"delay","time":"0.7","id":61},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothmovement","id":62},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"10","ystrength":"10","vibrato":"20","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"true","id":63},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","posfrom":"-80,0","posto":"-280,0","duration":"0.8","afrom":"1","ato":"0","id":64},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"-200,0","duration":"0.8","afrom":"1","ato":"0","id":65},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":66},{"type":"charslot","id":67},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1545_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":68},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1544_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":69},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":70},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1545_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":71},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老威尼斯","text":"......安东，这件事你并没有提前知会我。","id":72,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_npc_1545_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1544_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":73},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安东尼奥","text":"还请您不要怪罪。","id":74,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/89/Avg_avg_npc_1544_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安东尼奥","text":"警察刚刚来过了。他们要检查威尼斯旗下的载具工厂和检修站，说是狂欢节前的例行检查，公函却是临时开具的。","id":75,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/89/Avg_avg_npc_1544_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安东尼奥","text":"我刚刚还得到消息，阿尔贝托突然因为企业资质问题而被暂时拘留。","id":76,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/89/Avg_avg_npc_1544_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安东尼奥","text":"毫无疑问，上午的庭审刺激了我们的拉维妮娅大法官，她希望以这种手段控制她所未知的局势。","id":77,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/89/Avg_avg_npc_1544_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安东尼奥","text":"事情已经超出了我的控制，我不得不处置卡尔，否则很难服众。","id":78,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/89/Avg_avg_npc_1544_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1545_1#3$1","focus":"l","id":79},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老威尼斯","text":"......","id":80,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/12/Avg_avg_npc_1545_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1544_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":81},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安东尼奥","text":"这一年，威尼斯载具公司谨遵《新都市管理法案》，唯一留下的把柄，也在昨天港口的那场火里被烧掉了。","id":82,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/89/Avg_avg_npc_1544_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安东尼奥","text":"唯一一个可能影响到我们生意的人也处理了。","id":83,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/89/Avg_avg_npc_1544_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安东尼奥","text":"但等到狂欢节结束，拉维妮娅腾出手来，恐怕会尽全力针对我们。","id":84,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/89/Avg_avg_npc_1544_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1545_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":85},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老威尼斯","text":"你打算怎么处理？","id":86,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_npc_1545_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1544_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":87},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安东尼奥","text":"我本来的想法，是慢慢地改造这座城市——让它既有其他城市所没有的行之有效的法律，也有叙拉古人已经习以为常的地下秩序。","id":88,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/89/Avg_avg_npc_1544_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安东尼奥","text":"威尼斯载具公司的生意做得这么顺遂，诀窍只有两个：好好遵守《新都市管理法案》，不那么遵守《新都市管理法案》。","id":89,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/89/Avg_avg_npc_1544_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安东尼奥","text":"其他家族显然也在这么做，不过适应新的游戏规则是很难的。","id":90,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/89/Avg_avg_npc_1544_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安东尼奥","text":"威尼斯家族本可以完美地融入这两套秩序，我们已经做得很好了。","id":91,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/89/Avg_avg_npc_1544_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安东尼奥","text":"所以时至今日，我们能做到抛弃其中的一部分，并转而加速另一部分。","id":92,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/89/Avg_avg_npc_1544_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1545_1#6$1","focus":"l","id":93},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老威尼斯","text":"......","id":94,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/41/Avg_avg_npc_1545_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老威尼斯","text":"你想要，彻底控制这座城市？","id":95,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/41/Avg_avg_npc_1545_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1545_1#5$1","focus":"l","id":96},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老威尼斯","text":"你乱了阵脚，安东。别忘记，新沃尔西尼有西西里夫人的背书，她支持那群年轻人的改革。","id":97,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e3/Avg_avg_npc_1545_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老威尼斯","text":"你这样做，等于是在公开挑衅她的权威，与整个叙拉古作对。你在拿整个威尼斯家族打赌！","id":98,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e3/Avg_avg_npc_1545_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1544_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":99},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安东尼奥","text":"听起来是这样。","id":100,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/89/Avg_avg_npc_1544_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1545_1#5$1","focus":"l","id":101},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老威尼斯","text":"上一个这么做的，是贝纳尔多......他才死了一年！","id":102,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e3/Avg_avg_npc_1545_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1544_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":103},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安东尼奥","text":"您害怕西西里夫人，害怕市政厅里那些高喊理想的年轻人？","id":104,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/89/Avg_avg_npc_1544_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安东尼奥","text":"......爸爸，您是真的老了。","id":105,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/89/Avg_avg_npc_1544_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1545_1#5$1","focus":"l","id":106},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老威尼斯","text":"威尼斯是灰厅中最特别的存在，一个几乎由“杂种”组成的家族，没有血缘关系的离群的鲁珀，英格丽那样的沃尔珀，你这样的佩洛......","id":107,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e3/Avg_avg_npc_1545_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老威尼斯","text":"其他家族并没有多么瞧得上我们，但我们走到了今天。这里面凝聚了每一个威尼斯人的心血。","id":108,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e3/Avg_avg_npc_1545_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老威尼斯","text":"我们的联系比血缘更紧密，我希望家里的每个人都能有体面的结局。","id":109,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e3/Avg_avg_npc_1545_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老威尼斯","text":"而你想要将家族置于如此险境......安东，你似乎遗忘了我的教诲。","id":110,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e3/Avg_avg_npc_1545_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"all","id":111},{"type":"dialog","id":112},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1544_1#3$1","focus":"r","id":113},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":114},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1544_1#4$1","focus":"r","id":115},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安东尼奥","text":"爸爸，我是不是从来没讲过，我这只佩洛，是怎么来到叙拉古的？","id":116,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7b/Avg_avg_npc_1544_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1545_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":117},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老威尼斯","text":"......","id":118,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_npc_1545_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1544_1#4$1","focus":"r","id":119},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安东尼奥","text":"......我是个军人，隶属“真正玻利瓦尔人解放运动”。","id":120,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7b/Avg_avg_npc_1544_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1545_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":121},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老威尼斯","text":"我对玻利瓦尔的局势，只有一些很粗浅的了解......","id":122,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_npc_1545_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1544_1#4$1","focus":"r","id":123},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安东尼奥","text":"其实在玻利瓦尔，给谁当兵都没有任何区别，你不用懂三方势力为什么打仗，反正我们这些人不过是靠卖命讨一条活路。","id":124,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7b/Avg_avg_npc_1544_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安东尼奥","text":"我所在的游击队在扫荡辛嘉斯王朝的一个村镇时暴露了行踪，整支队伍都成了俘虏。","id":125,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7b/Avg_avg_npc_1544_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安东尼奥","text":"我们这二十号人掏干净了身上的每一个口袋，凑了所有家当买通行刑官，求他把我们在名单上的身份从“死刑犯”改成了“劳役犯”。","id":126,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7b/Avg_avg_npc_1544_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安东尼奥","text":"负责转运我们的上级官员，是个大腹便便的贵族，他那天喝醉了酒，弄错了审核程序，只开来了一辆卡车......只够坐十个人。","id":127,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7b/Avg_avg_npc_1544_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1544_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":128},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安东尼奥","text":"行刑官质问他怎么办，您知道那个家伙是什么反应吗？","id":129,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/89/Avg_avg_npc_1544_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1545_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":130},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老威尼斯","text":"......","id":131,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_npc_1545_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1544_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":132},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安东尼奥","text":"他一边打着酒嗝，一边掏出笔在我们的名单上随手画了一个圈，说：“名单上明明只有这十个人，不是吗？”","id":133,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/89/Avg_avg_npc_1544_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安东尼奥","text":"我们杀了他，割下了他的脑袋，逃离了玻利瓦尔，再后来的事情，您就知道了。","id":134,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/89/Avg_avg_npc_1544_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1545_1#6$1","focus":"l","id":135},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老威尼斯","text":"安东，你从来没有提过——","id":136,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/41/Avg_avg_npc_1545_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1544_1#10$1","focus":"r","id":137},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安东尼奥","text":"太久了，哈哈，久到我几乎忘了。","id":138,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a8/Avg_avg_npc_1544_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1544_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":139},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安东尼奥","text":"您知道我重新想起来这件事，是因为什么吗？","id":140,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/89/Avg_avg_npc_1544_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1544_1#8$1","focus":"r","id":141},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安东尼奥","text":"我去找年轻有为的市长大人商讨新沃尔西尼的物流建设，他在拒绝我后，向我分享了这座新城市的由来和使命......","id":142,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/70/Avg_avg_npc_1544_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安东尼奥","text":"所谓的“试验场”，将旧的人放进来，再用与叙拉古传统迥异的新秩序去管理它......","id":143,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/70/Avg_avg_npc_1544_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安东尼奥","text":"他们知道必然会有人应激，会有不可调和的矛盾，甚至会有一群又一群人在这个过程中被吞没......但是为了可能的未来，无所谓。","id":144,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/70/Avg_avg_npc_1544_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安东尼奥","text":"而这一切，都只是因为四个年轻人坐在了灰厅的圆桌前，进行了一番慷慨激昂的游说......","id":145,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/70/Avg_avg_npc_1544_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安东尼奥","text":"西西里夫人便大手一挥，从叙拉古二十三座移动城市里拨了一座给他们......","id":146,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/70/Avg_avg_npc_1544_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安东尼奥","text":"轻率得就像当时那个贵族随手在我们的名字上画了一个圈。","id":147,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/70/Avg_avg_npc_1544_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安东尼奥","text":"爸爸，莱昂图索当时讲得很真诚，也很振奋，我却差点按捺不住地想笑出声......这个年轻的傻小子什么都不懂。","id":148,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/70/Avg_avg_npc_1544_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安东尼奥","text":"您刚刚说，我乱了阵脚？","id":149,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/70/Avg_avg_npc_1544_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安东尼奥","text":"不，不是的，我要做的事情，从来都没有变过。","id":150,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/70/Avg_avg_npc_1544_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":151},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1544_1#9$1","focus":"r","id":152},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安东尼奥","text":"我讨厌那个贵族，讨厌西西里夫人，我讨厌他们随手画圈的权力，我要把这一切，从他们手中夺过来！","id":153,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/eb/Avg_avg_npc_1544_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1545_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":154},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老威尼斯","text":"安东......","id":155,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_npc_1545_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1544_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":156},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安东尼奥","text":"呼——好了爸爸，我说得有点多了。我今天不是来听您教诲什么是体面，也不是来分析叙拉古的局势的。","id":157,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/89/Avg_avg_npc_1544_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安东尼奥","text":"单凭我这一年的运作，还不足以让我们坐上赌桌......","id":158,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/89/Avg_avg_npc_1544_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安东尼奥","text":"爸爸，家里有一艘陆行舰正在离此不远的航线上吧？我想要它的紧急调度权。","id":159,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/89/Avg_avg_npc_1544_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安东尼奥","text":"而这，是家主才能做到的事情。","id":160,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/89/Avg_avg_npc_1544_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":161},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_soldiersrun","volume":"0.5","id":162},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":163},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":164},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1545_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":165},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老威尼斯","text":"我要是不答应，守在门外的那些人，大概会像对付卡尔那样对付我？","id":166,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_npc_1545_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1544_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":167},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安东尼奥","text":"那倒是不会，您是个真正的体面人。","id":168,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/89/Avg_avg_npc_1544_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"left","name":"avg_npc_1545_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":169},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老威尼斯","text":"......","id":170,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_npc_1545_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"right","name":"avg_npc_1544_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":171},{"type":"dialogue","name":"安东尼奥","text":"爸爸，您老了。您不是一直把退休挂在嘴边吗？","id":172,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/89/Avg_avg_npc_1544_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":173},{"type":"dialog","id":174},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":175},{"type":"charslot","id":176},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":177},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d7/Avg_bg_56_g9_truckcamp.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":178},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":179},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":180},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$darkness01_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta1_180603/m_dia_darkness01_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":181,"musicid":1},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"0.7","id":182},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4065_judge_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":183},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":184},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉维妮娅","text":"请问，伊雷妮不在营地吗？","id":185,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f2/Avg_avg_4065_judge_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":186},{"type":"charslot","id":187},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1550_1#1$1","duration":"0.5","id":188},{"type":"delay","time":"0.6","id":189},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡车司机","text":"......大、大法官女士？","id":190,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cc/Avg_avg_npc_1550_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡车司机","text":"呃、呃，伊雷妮不在。大家伙为了祝贺伊雷妮无罪释放，去庆祝了。","id":191,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cc/Avg_avg_npc_1550_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4065_judge_1#1$1","id":192},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉维妮娅","text":"那你为什么没有去？","id":193,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f2/Avg_avg_4065_judge_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1550_1#1$1","id":194},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡车司机","text":"我、我、您看，我不是还在检修这些卡车吗？","id":195,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cc/Avg_avg_npc_1550_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡车司机","text":"明天就是狂欢节了，多的是用车的地方......","id":196,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cc/Avg_avg_npc_1550_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡车司机","text":"总得有人来保养吧。","id":197,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cc/Avg_avg_npc_1550_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4065_judge_1#1$1","id":198},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉维妮娅","text":"......","id":199,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f2/Avg_avg_4065_judge_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉维妮娅","text":"你在撒谎，先生。","id":200,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f2/Avg_avg_4065_judge_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"拉维妮娅","text":"见到伊雷妮之后，麻烦告诉她，我需要见她，随时都可以。","id":201,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f2/Avg_avg_4065_judge_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1550_1#1$1","id":202},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡车司机","text":"......好。","id":203,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cc/Avg_avg_npc_1550_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":204},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4065_judge_1#1$1","id":205},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":206},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"0.7","id":207},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1","id":208},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":209},{"type":"dialog","id":210},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":211},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":212},{"type":"charslot","id":213},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":214},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0b/Avg_bg_56_g11_newvolsiniipier.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":215},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":216},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":217},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$escape_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta2_180603/m_dia_escape_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":218,"musicid":2},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1561_1#1$1","duration":"0.5","id":219},{"type":"delay","time":"0.8","id":220},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡车司机","text":"伊雷妮，给，这一年的排班表。","id":221,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_npc_1561_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡车司机","text":"按照你说的，我把和威尼斯载具公司有关的记录都标记了出来，每一趟出车的时间、载货说明、司机的名字......都在上面。","id":222,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_npc_1561_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":223},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1542_1#2$1","id":224},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_paper1","id":225},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":226},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊雷妮","text":"嗯，和索默尔笔记本上写的都对得上。","id":227,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/99/Avg_avg_npc_1542_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊雷妮","text":"索默尔要接小古莉来新沃尔西尼；卡米洛一直偷偷靠酒精压制伤病，不得不求助互助会之外的人；吉安和鲁杰罗也各有各的难处......","id":228,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/99/Avg_avg_npc_1542_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊雷妮","text":"每一个被盯上的成员，都是他们精挑细选过的。","id":229,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/99/Avg_avg_npc_1542_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊雷妮","text":"出车记录不算多，但频率很稳定，那天晚上绝对不是他们第一次偷运武器进城......","id":230,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/99/Avg_avg_npc_1542_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":231},{"type":"charslot","id":232},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"0.7","id":233},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":234},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":235},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"伊雷妮，你没猜错，那个法官的确去营地找了你。她走后，后面还有几个家族的成员鬼鬼祟祟跟着她。","id":236,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/26/Avg_avg_1502_crosly_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1542_1#6$1","id":237},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊雷妮","text":"那......","id":238,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/64/Avg_avg_npc_1542_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1","id":239},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"我一直开车跟在后面，看她走进了法院才回来。","id":240,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/26/Avg_avg_1502_crosly_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1542_1#2$1","id":241},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊雷妮","text":"那就好。","id":242,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/99/Avg_avg_npc_1542_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#3$1","id":243},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"还有一件事。","id":244,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ea/Avg_avg_1502_crosly_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1542_1#2$1","id":245},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊雷妮","text":"什么？","id":246,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/99/Avg_avg_npc_1542_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1","id":247},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"我正好看见萨卢佐酒业的法务团队急匆匆地进了法院。","id":248,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/26/Avg_avg_1502_crosly_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"我打听了一下，就在不久前，警察毫无预兆地去了萨卢佐的酒庄，带走了阿尔贝托。","id":249,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/26/Avg_avg_1502_crosly_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"同时被找上的，还有威尼斯载具公司。现在警察和法官应该在对他们的工厂进行临检。","id":250,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/26/Avg_avg_1502_crosly_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1542_1#4$1","id":251},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊雷妮","text":"拉维妮娅应该还不知道武器的事，但车祸和港口失火传递出来的信号已经很危险......","id":252,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a0/Avg_avg_npc_1542_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊雷妮","text":"莱昂图索受了伤，至今还在医院，她作为新沃尔西尼的大法官，只能想尽办法控制局势。","id":253,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a0/Avg_avg_npc_1542_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1","id":254},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"她没有直接对卡车互助会采用同样的手段......她是来警告我们的。","id":255,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/26/Avg_avg_1502_crosly_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1542_1#8$1","id":256},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊雷妮","text":"或者说，最后通牒。","id":257,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8f/Avg_avg_npc_1542_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1561_1#1$1","id":258},{"type":"dialogue","name":"卡车司机","text":"等等，那柳德米拉刚刚说的......","id":259,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_npc_1561_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1542_1#8$1","id":260},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊雷妮","text":"不管是阿尔贝托，还是小威尼斯，都不可能坐以待毙。","id":261,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8f/Avg_avg_npc_1542_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊雷妮","text":"拉维妮娅现在很危险。","id":262,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8f/Avg_avg_npc_1542_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#1$1","id":263},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"那些家伙只是跟在法官的身后，并没有动手的意思。","id":264,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/26/Avg_avg_1502_crosly_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1542_1#2$1","id":265},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊雷妮","text":"这里毕竟是新沃尔西尼，警察还在街道上巡逻呢。而且，不是有一个现成的更好的时机吗？","id":266,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/99/Avg_avg_npc_1542_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#5$1","id":267},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"你是说，狂欢节......","id":268,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a3/Avg_avg_1502_crosly_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"我们可以去提醒那个法官。","id":269,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a3/Avg_avg_1502_crosly_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":270},{"type":"text","text":"伊雷妮没有动，良久，她摇了摇头。","id":271},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#5$1","id":272},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"你还是不想让她知道互助会的事情，可你真能眼睁睁看着她出事吗？","id":273,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a3/Avg_avg_1502_crosly_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"至少，她人不坏。","id":274,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a3/Avg_avg_1502_crosly_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1542_1#5$1","id":275},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊雷妮","text":"......你误会了，柳德米拉。","id":276,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/ae/Avg_avg_npc_1542_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1542_1#2$1","id":277},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊雷妮","text":"我们如今想要置身事外已经来不及了。","id":278,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/99/Avg_avg_npc_1542_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊雷妮","text":"如果那些家族敢在狂欢节上直接对拉维妮娅动手，那他们更加不会放过卡车互助会。到时候，我们只能任他们宰割。","id":279,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/99/Avg_avg_npc_1542_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1542_1#8$1","id":280},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊雷妮","text":"我只是在想到底应该怎么做。我不想再看到像索默尔那样......","id":281,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8f/Avg_avg_npc_1542_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#6$1","id":282},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"......","id":283,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_1502_crosly_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1542_1#4$1","id":284},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊雷妮","text":"直接告诉拉维妮娅，并不是最好的选择。","id":285,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a0/Avg_avg_npc_1542_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1542_1#2$1","id":286},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊雷妮","text":"柳德米拉，你见过那批武器？有多少？","id":287,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/99/Avg_avg_npc_1542_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#7$1","id":288},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"按照那个量和排班表上的总记录来估算——","id":289,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/91/Avg_avg_1502_crosly_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"威尼斯在城内的武器大概够武装几个战术小队，几十号人。","id":290,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/91/Avg_avg_1502_crosly_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1542_1#2$1","id":291},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊雷妮","text":"我们光登记在册的正式成员就有两百多人，算上那些临时雇佣人员和合同工的话，人数还得翻几番。","id":292,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/99/Avg_avg_npc_1542_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊雷妮","text":"我突然意识到，卡车互助会其实是整个新沃尔西尼规模最大的组织。","id":293,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/99/Avg_avg_npc_1542_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊雷妮","text":"如果只是暗中保护一个人的话，或许还是做得到的。","id":294,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/99/Avg_avg_npc_1542_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#6$1","id":295},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"......你真的只是想要保护那个法官吗？","id":296,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_1502_crosly_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":297},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1542_1#3$1","id":298},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":299},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1542_1#2$1","id":300},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊雷妮","text":"索默尔至少教会了我一件事，那就是除了我们自己，这座城市里的任何人都不值得信任。","id":301,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/99/Avg_avg_npc_1542_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1542_1#8$1","id":302},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊雷妮","text":"我们只能靠自己保护自己......哪怕那意味着暴力。","id":303,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8f/Avg_avg_npc_1542_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#6$1","id":304},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"......","id":305,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_1502_crosly_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#2$1","id":306},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"在乌萨斯的时候，我认识一个有类似想法的人。她最后迷失了自我。","id":307,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bf/Avg_avg_1502_crosly_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1542_1#2$1","id":308},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊雷妮","text":"你想拦下我？","id":309,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/99/Avg_avg_npc_1542_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#3$1","id":310},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"不......索默尔的事情需要有一个结局。","id":311,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ea/Avg_avg_1502_crosly_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"但显然，他也不会愿意看到那样的你。","id":312,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/ea/Avg_avg_1502_crosly_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1502_crosly_1#7$1","id":313},{"type":"dialogue","name":"柳德米拉","text":"伊雷妮，我会确保你不会越过最后那条线......","id":314,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/91/Avg_avg_1502_crosly_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1542_1#2$1","id":315},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊雷妮","text":"我答应你，柳德米拉。","id":316,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/99/Avg_avg_npc_1542_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"伊雷妮","text":"我很清楚自己在做什么。","id":317,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/99/Avg_avg_npc_1542_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":318},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":319},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":320},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":321},{"type":"image","id":322},{"type":"charslot","id":323}],"characters":["惶恐的家族成员","老威尼斯","安东尼奥","拉维妮娅","卡车司机","伊雷妮","柳德米拉"]}